<title>FINLAND: KAUPPAKAARI JAN-APRIL PROFIT STEADY.</title>
<headline>KAUPPAKAARI JAN-APRIL PROFIT STEADY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     7.3 vs 7.6</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.39 vs 1.62</p>
<p> Net sales					  132.2 vs 125.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				   7.2 vs 7.6</p>
<p> Net profit					   4.9 vs 4.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    57.3 vs 40.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish niche publisher is Kauppakaari</p>
<p>Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
